WEBVTT - Proven site upgrade: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.964
An upgrade is done when visitors see no
difference. Can you prove it?

2
00:00:08.064 --> 00:00:13.406
Proven site upgrade: four skills for TYPO3 v14.

3
00:00:14.706 --> 00:00:23.365
Upgrades a site from v12 or v13 to 14.3 LTS and
proves that visitors see no difference.

4
00:00:24.715 --> 00:00:31.937
The final proof of a real run: 360 screenshots,
no undeclared difference.

5
00:00:33.037 --> 00:00:40.103
A read-only preflight of repository, runtime,
database, files, extensions and risks.

6
00:00:41.453 --> 00:00:45.750
An upgrade that starts from the wrong database
proves nothing.

7
00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:55.104
Captures responses, HTML and screenshots of the
untouched site and seals them as Baseline A.

8
00:00:56.454 --> 00:00:59.915
A comparison is only as good as its reference.

9
00:01:01.504 --> 00:01:08.674
Compares the upgraded site with the baseline and
closes only when nothing unexplained changed.

10
00:01:10.024 --> 00:01:16.541
It never accepts an unexplained difference and
never refreshes the baseline to make one
disappear.

11
00:01:18.141 --> 00:01:22.203
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
